  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Static File Improvements\n      - Added automatic `.html` fallback for extensionless routes (`/about` → `/about.html`).\n      - Reduced redundant cache lookups in the static file pipeline.\n      - Improved request routing and static path resolution.\n      - Optimized exact path matching for better performance.\n      - Added automatic fallback to `/404.html` when no custom 404 mapping is configured.\n\n      Performance\n      - Static file throughput improved from ~160K req/s to ~180K req/s (~12%).\n      - Lower memory usage during stress testing (≈100–300 MB → ≈30–60 MB).",
